        <item>
            <title>3.0.4</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:13:43 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>150</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- When a session's background process stops (for example, the Claude Code extension fails to start), the window, other Macs, and the phone now show why, instead of reporting a lost network connection.
- Older entries in the update feed point at their own downloads again; they used to point at the newest release and fail.

### Changes
- Updated Sparkle to 2.10.0, which fixes applying delta updates on macOS 27.
]]></description>
